p plates and bowls (product page). CJ pid 2409020723381627600, listedNum 14. Was rejected 2026-10-17 (largest plate 23) before AU5 widened the dinner plate to 23-28. Colors, dimensions and texture filled from the listing photos (estimates; check at QA)."
